  "description": "# Cross-chain Proposal: Add Arks to LazyVault_LowerRisk_USDCe Fleet\n\n## Summary\nThis is a cross-chain governance proposal to add 2 new Ark(s) to the existing LazyVault_LowerRisk_USDCe Fleet on sonic.\n\n## Motivation\nExpanding this fleet with additional Arks will enhance the protocol's capabilities on sonic.\n\n## Technical Details\n- Hub Chain: base (Production)\n- Target Chain: sonic\n- Fleet Commander: 0x507A2D9E87DBD3076e65992049C41270b47964f8\n- Number of Arks to add: 2\n\n## New Ark Addresses\n1. `0x5c841955d7EE3E2F7a077Aa0aCa3A7d724b15Da2`\n2. `0x42AAdE02448FdAf56Bbb153B2984E3d53DC531c1`\n\n## Specifications\n### Actions\nThis proposal will execute the following actions on sonic:\n1. Grant COMMANDER_ROLE to Fleet Commander for each Ark\n2. Add each Ark to the Fleet Commander\n\n### Cross-chain Mechanism\nThis proposal uses LayerZero to execute governance actions across chains.\n\n## References\nDiscourse: https://forum.summer.fi/t/the-path-to-1b-tvl-onboard-medium-and-high-risk-vaults-for-lazy-summer-protocol/113\n",
